# Stack: frontend Rust WASM

Package choices only. `crates/` layout and JS loader seams live in `frontend-rust-wasm` / `rust-core`. Attach with the WASM extra.

| Concern | Choice | Notes / fallback |
|---------|--------|------------------|
| JS glue | wasm-bindgen | Only in `wasm_bridge` (cdylib) |
| Build | wasm-pack (or equivalent) | Output to `src/shared/gen/wasm/` — do not hand-edit |
| Small DTOs | serde-wasm-bindgen | Prefer numbers / typed arrays in hot loops |
| Engine errors | thiserror | In the pure engine crate, not the bridge |
